  "review": "The park-wide photograph identifies the miniature’s terrace by its dome, the adjacent plaza and the enclosing walkways. The visible terrace edges set the signed northwest stair facing and a scale of 0.875. The fitted anchor sits 0.25 m behind the traced center to clear the drawn footway within the image measurement uncertainty. The browser placed all four model tiers and kept the surrounding paths and building. All three stair approaches cleared the pavement on the 1 m and 2 m terrain grids.",
